╰───────│                                                              │
        │  what the short forms mean                                   │
        │  ctx 42%         context window used                         │
        │  5h 23%          the five-hour rate-limit window             │
        │  ↻ 2h            when that window resets                     │
        │  159c            tool calls this session (c is calls)        │
        │  1 err           tool results that came back an error        │
        │  R× E× W×        reads, edits, writes of one file            │
        │  +12 −3          lines added and removed                     │
        │  ↕tokens         the column a list is sorted by (s rotates)  │
        │  ≈               estimated, not read from the transcript     │
        │  —               no source for it on this machine            │
        │  ⚠ re-read       a file read again with no edit between      │
